     4	
     5	1. **Stop** (paused, records kept):
     6	   - answer-choice changes and D656's listing census;
     7	   - model trials;
     8	   - further live-store, planner and integration work.
     9	
    10	   The page fix for completed replays (D564, D571–D572) addressed a real display defect. It stays, and is not called drift. D658 is **not**
    11	   recorded as paused: Alex is asked today whether it may be deferred until his marks.
