docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-8/narrow-d436/audit-v2-claude.md:3:Defects: (1a) the share clause never requires the outcome to track the figure itself (u3/clean-11's outcome tracks an ASIC/GPU split whose total is only the base; "ask the figure" would move it to total spending, against D397); (1b) "whether supply stays short of demand" leaves "a figure" unbound (a revenue named beside a component shortage would become one bet, a shape D436 never named). (1c) capacity clause consistent. (1d) a sourced exception to line 6; D436's scope line names clean Step 1, carried here by its "(D397)" clause; the record should say so. (1e) "the share or the shortage" omits the capacity side (the utility example covers it). The no_ladder description does not carry the exception (not a contradiction).
