Report the six lines and enforce the parts code can decide. Remove their combined release veto. [D400](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:4381) · [Working rules](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/AGENTS.md:332)  
Use the six-week archive reading to find failures. Require a demonstrated gain of more than 10 points against current production for release. [D663](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9374) · [D431](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:4795)  
